          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 11 2021 15:12:31 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Stryker leaders recently shared their perspectives on diversity, equity and inclusion (DE&amp;I) in Savoy Magazine, a forum for workplace diversity and the roles African Americans play in today's business world.&nbsp;The special issue offers a spotlight on corporate diversity, which Stryker is proud to support through sponsorship.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nTristan Moss and Robbie Robinson, the co-presidents of Stryker’s African Ancestry Network (SAAN), touched on our organization’s current DE&amp;I focus, as well as what it means to have a diverse, equitable and inclusive MedTech industry.<br>\n<br>\nSavoy Magazine is a national African American business and lifestyle magazine that showcases positive dialogue on and about Black culture, including profiles of some of the nation’s top Black executives.<br>\n<br>\n<span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><a href=\"http://savoynetwork.com/driving-for-a-more-inclusive-workplace-and-industry-spotlight-on-stryker/\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Read the full article here.</span></a><br>\n </span><br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Feb 24 2021 18:36:40 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
