          "jcr:created": "Mon Feb 15 2021 19:19:30 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n “We are fostering a culture&nbsp;that makes room for all our current and future employees to be themselves at work and allow their talent to lead them to new career opportunities.”</span>&nbsp;<br>\n <br>\n </span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #af6d04;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">~Tristan Moss</span></span></span></p>\n",
